{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "325e62d8-ea57-8c36-9b0d-1117799130d8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T13:15:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:12:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Merry Christmas Eve, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I have an old refrigerator. In the garage. I want it gone. Do you take that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a refrigerator. So appliances like that, they're usually not just set out with the regular trash. Is it the regular household pickup you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:12:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think so. I don't know. I have the shop in front and the apartment upstairs. The truck comes. I just don't know which one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha, that's all right. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:12:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "441 Admiral Kalbfus Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:12:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "441 Admiral Kalbfus, North End. Okay, let me write that down. And you said it's a fridge, not a freezer or an air conditioner or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A refrigerator. White. It works, no. It doesn't work. It stopped in the fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, doesn't work. Usually those need a special pickup, because of the coolant. You'd have to schedule it, you can't just leave it at the curb. So I'll note that you want a bulky item pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I put it at the curb. When?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not yet. Don't put it out until it's scheduled. Otherwise it just sits there and somebody writes you up for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I thought you said the curb. Okay. Not the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, hold off on the curb. Let me look at your regular day, hang on. [pause] Okay, I've got you on Thursday pickups in that area, but with the holiday, it's moving. Tomorrow's Christmas, so it'd slide to Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Friday. This Friday. Not Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait. Which week? This one coming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This coming Friday, the twenty-sixth. Then back to normal Thursday the week after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Friday. Then the refrigerator is a different day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Different, yeah. I'll put in the request and somebody will call you with a date for the fridge. That number you're on, same one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0199. That's the shop. I answer it upstairs too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 401-555-0199. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was cleaning the garage. I found a postcard. I collect them, old ones. Vintage. This one is rare. Newport, from a long time ago. I was not looking for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a nice find in the middle of cleaning out a garage. Hope it's in good shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is good. Okay. So Friday for the trash. And the refrigerator, somebody calls. And not the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Friday for regular, a call for the fridge, and keep it inside till then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Happy holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Leo. Take care."
    }
  ],
